      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote><p>\"<i>Dolbur is always positive. But sometimes he makes mistakes.</i>\"<br />— <a href=\"/wiki/Pio\" title=\"Pio\">Pio</a>, <i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></p></blockquote>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Dolbur (돌버) <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Characters\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/3/36/Characters.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150527022122\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Characters.png\" data-image-key=\"Characters.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span></h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/e/ec/DolburPortrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20150611011146\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"DolburPortrait\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/e/ec/DolburPortrait.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20150611011146\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/e/ec/DolburPortrait.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20150611011146 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/e/ec/DolburPortrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20150611011146 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"DolburPortrait\" width=\"270\" height=\"276\" data-image-key=\"DolburPortrait.png\" data-image-name=\"DolburPortrait.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"name\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Name</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Dolbur (돌버)</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"age\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Age</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">21</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"height\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Height</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">179.5 cm</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"occup\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Occupation</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Warrior</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"species\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Species</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Unknown</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"firstintroduced\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Introduced In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lastseen\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Last Appearance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ongoing</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Dolbur</b> is an adventurer that appears in <i><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_Maker\" title=\"Potion Maker\">Potion Maker</a></i>. When his quest is completed, he awards the <a href=\"/wiki/Powerup\" title=\"Powerup\">enhancement bonus</a> item, which adds <span style=\"font-family: Courier;\">10%</span> to a potion's enhancement success rate.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Character\">Character</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDolbur%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Dolbur is an energetic warrior who goes on quests.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/2/2f/DolburProfile.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20150614070852\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Info on Dolbur.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/potionmaker/images/2/2f/DolburProfile.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20150614070852\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"98\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"DolburProfile.jpg\" data-image-key=\"DolburProfile.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:DolburProfile.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Info on Dolbur.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest\">Quest</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDolbur%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Normal\">Normal</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpotionmaker.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FDolbur%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>When his quest is completed, 10 <a href=\"/wiki/Powerup#Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Powerup\">enhancement bonus items</a> are rewarded.\n</p>\n<table class=\"navtemplate\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"background:#660099\" colspan=\"2\">Characters\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th width=\"65px\" style=\"background:#ddd\">Protagonist